#1614
sage elder old man elf elven~
the elder sage~
An old man, dressed in an old robe.
~
The robes of the elder sage seem to slowly shift from white through gray to
black and then back again.  He looks at you sternly, as if weighing your soul.
 "I can change your inner self, but it will cost you 25,000 coins.  You can
switch your alignment by TELLing me "Sage, change me to (align)", using good,
evil or neutral for the (align).  I will change your alignment, and take your
money.  I do not check which alignment you are first, so be careful!"
~
20971587 4194456&256 0 C
55 0 -195 5d5+2150 4d5+48
200 0
112 112 1
13 13 13 13 13 13 13
0 0 0 0 0
1 15 0 0 3 1 0
0 0 15 1048576 0 0 35651584 6
> speech_prog 'Sage, change me to evil'~
if clantype($n) == 0
  mpechoat $n I don't think your god would be too happy with you messing with your alignment!
else
   if goldamt($n) < 25000
     mpechoat $n You don't have enough money for that!
   else
     mpmset $n align -1000
     mpechoat $n Your alignment is now evil!
     mpforce $n give 25000 coins sage
   endif
endif~
> speech_prog 'Sage, change me to neutral'~
if clantype($n) == 0
  mpechoat $n I don't think your god would be too happy with you messing with your alignment!
else
   if goldamt($n) < 25000
     mpechoat $n You don't have enough money for that!
   else
     mpmset $n align 0
     mpechoat $n Your alignment is now neutral!
     mpforce $n give 25000 coins sage
   endif
endif~
> speech_prog 'Sage, change me to good'~
if clantype($n) == 0
  mpechoat $n I don't think your god would be too happy with you messing with your alignment!
else
   if goldamt($n) < 25000
     mpechoat $n You don't have enough money for that!
   else
     mpmset $n align 1000
     mpechoat $n Your alignment is now good!
     mpforce $n give 25000 coins sage
   endif
endif~
